    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d248">

                <pb facs="0354" n="342" sameAs="frus:frus1946v07/pg342"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.24591/3–646: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Kennan</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1946-03-06T16:00:00+03:00">March 6, 1946—4
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received March 6—10:30 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>682. Text of note set forth in Dept’s 385, March 5 concerning failure Soviet Govt
                    to withdraw troops from Iran has been transmitted urgently to Molotov this
                    morning.</p>
                <p>Sent Dept as 682 repeated Tehran as 45 and London as 124.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Kennan</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
